[[14,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Release the sensor from the retainers.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Solar sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>See K90 SOLAR SENSOR</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Recover the sensor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125005036.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[14,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the sensor is not damaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Fit the sensor in position and engage the retainers.</p>"]]